ts display them with pride.</p></div><div class=\"card-surface gold-seam p-6 lg:col-span-2\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(16px)\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield mb-4 text-gold\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path></svg><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-navy\">Verified by Purchase</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm text-text-muted\">Every review ties to a confirmed order invitation. No guest reviews. No open submissions. No adding stars without verification.</p></div><div class=\"card-surface gold-seam p-6 lg:col-span-2\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(16px)\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-search mb-4 text-gold\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m21 21-4.34-4.34\"></path><circle cx=\"11\" cy=\"11\" r=\"8\"></circle></svg><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-navy\">Google Seller Ratings</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm text-text-muted\">JSON-LD schema auto-injects. Stars appear in Search and Shopping within 72 hours.</p></div><div class=\"card-surface gold-seam p-6 lg:col-span-2\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(16px)\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-mail mb-4 text-gold\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m22 7-8.991 5.727a2 2 0 0 1-2.009 0L2 7\"></path><rect x=\"2\" y=\"4\" width=\"20\" height=\"16\" rx=\"2\"></rect></svg><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-navy\">Multi-Channel Invitations</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm text-text-muted\">Email, SMS, or QR code. Smart timing sends 7 days post-delivery.</p></div><div class=\"card-surface gold-seam p-6 lg:col-span-2\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(16px)\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-palette mb-4 text-gold\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 22a1 1 0 0 1 0-20 10 9 0 0 1 10 9 5 5 0 0 1-5 5h-2.25a1.75 1.75 0 0 0-1.4 2.8l.3.4a1.75 1.75 0 0 1-1.4 2.8z\"></path><circle cx=\"13.5\" cy=\"6.5\" r=\".5\" fill=\"currentColor\"></circle><circle cx=\"17.5\" cy=\"10.5\" r=\".5\" fill=\"currentColor\"></circle><circle cx=\"6.5\" cy=\"12.5\" r=\".5\" fill=\"currentColor\"></circle><circle cx=\"8.5\" cy=\"7.5\" r=\".5\" fill=\"currentColor\"></circle></svg><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-navy\">White-Label for Agencies</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm text-text-muted\">Custom domain, your logo in the star center, 25 sub-accounts — one Agency plan.</p></div><div class=\"card-surface gold-seam p-6 lg:col-span-2\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(16px)\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chart-column mb-4 text-gold\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 3v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h16\"></path><path d=\"M18 17V9\"></path><path d=\"M13 17V5\"></path><path d=\"M8 17v-3\"></path></svg><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-navy\">Full Analytics</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm text-text-muted\">Rating distribution, sentiment trends, invitation response rates, and conversion correlation.</p></div></div></div></section><section id=\"how-it-works\" class=\"section-stone border-y border-border py-24\" data-scroll-theme=\"light\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4\"><p class=\"text-center text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-navy-light\">How reviews earn their star</p><h2 class=\"mt-3 text-center text-3xl font-bold text-navy\">No random reviews. No fake scores. Just buyers who actually ordered.</h2><p class=\"mx-auto mt-4 max-w-2xl text-center text-sm text-text-muted\">Every review passes order verification, fraud screening, and your approval before it publishes — or it never touches your rating.</p><div class=\"relative mt-16 space-y-12\"><div class=\"card-surface relative p-6 pl-16\"><div class=\"absolute left-6 top-6 flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-full border-2 border-gold bg-gold-pale text-xs font-bold text-gold-dark\">01</div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-navy\">Connect orders</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm text-text-muted\">Link your store or import past reviews matched to orders — one-time migration, then invitations only.</p></div><div class=\"card-surface relative p-6 pl-16\"><div class=\"absolute left-6 top-6 flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-full border-2 border-gold bg-gold-pale text-xs font-bold text-gold-dark\">02</div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-navy\">Invite real buyers</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm text-text-muted\">Fulfilled orders trigger branded invitations. No open form, no guest reviews, no bought ratings.</p></div><div class=\"card-surface relative p-6 pl-16\"><div class=\"absolute left-6 top-6 flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-full border-2 border-gold bg-gold-pale text-xs font-bold text-gold-dark\">03</div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-navy\">Every review earns its star</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm text-text-muted\">Purchase check → fraud score → your approval → publish. Only then does it count toward your badge.</p></div></div></div></section></main><footer class=\"border-t border-border bg-navy text-white\" data-scroll-theme=\"dark\"><section class=\"py-20 text-center\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4\"><h2 class=\"font-display text-3xl italic text-gold\">Stop guessing if customers trust you.</h2><p class=\"mt-4 text-white/70\">Show them proof. 1,200+ stores collect verified reviews with EarnedStar.</p><a class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-lg border font-semibold transition duration-200 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-navy bg-gold text-ink hover:bg-gold-light border-transparent shadow-[var(--shadow-gold)] h-12 px-6 text-base mt-8\" href=\"/signup\">Start Your Free Trial →</a></div></section><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-7xl border-t border-white/10 px-4 py-12\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-10 md:grid-cols-[2fr_1fr_1fr_1fr_1fr]\"><div><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2\"><svg width=\"37\" height=\"37\" viewBox=\"0 0 37 37\" overflow=\"visible\" class=\"shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M15.63,9.32 Q18.50,2.15 21.37,9.32 L21.62,9.95 Q22.72,12.69 25.67,12.89 L26.35,12.93 Q34.05,13.45 28.12,18.39 L27.60,18.83 Q25.33,20.72 26.05,23.58 L26.22,24.24 Q28.11,31.73 21.58,27.61 L21.00,27.25 Q18.50,25.68 16.00,27.25 L15.42,27.61 Q8.89,31.73 10.78,24.24 L10.95,23.58 Q11.67,20.72 9.40,18.83 L8.88,18.39 Q2.95,13.45 10.65,12.93 L11.33,12.89 Q14.28,12.69 15.38,9.95 Z\" fill=\"rgba(255,255,255,0.05)\" stroke=\"rgba(255,255,255,0.78)\" stroke-width=\"0.814\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path><line x1=\"18.5\" y1=\"18.5\" x2=\"18.5\" y2=\"2.146000000000001\" stroke=\"rgba(255,255,255,0.28)\" stroke-width=\"0.481\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></line><line x1=\"18.5\" y1=\"18.5\" x2=\"34.05357826749094\" y2=\"13.44633607399211\" stroke=\"rgba(255,255,255,0.28)\" stroke-width=\"0.481\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></line><line x1=\"18.5\" y1=\"18.5\" x2=\"28.112640015991104\" y2=\"31.730663926007892\" stroke=\"rgba(255,255,255,0.28)\" stroke-width=\"0.481\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></line><line x1=\"18.5\" y1=\"18.5\" x2=\"8.887359984008897\" y2=\"31.730663926007892\" str